BT 1 0 0 1 0 56.4 Tm /F2+0 9.1 Tf 13.1 TL (For years, concrete walls hid the Brookfield stream beneath the main road. During a flood study, engineers found that) Tj T* (opening part of the channel could slow water and create a green walking route. The first stage removed a short section) Tj T* (of concrete and planted native grasses along the banks. The work did not solve every flood risk, so the city also) Tj T* (upgraded drains upstream. Residents now use the path, and schools visit to test water quality. The project shows that a) Tj T* (public space can be useful while supporting local wildlife.) Tj T* ET
