0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 56.4 Tm /F2+0 9.1 Tf 13.1 TL (Buying a used phone can save money and reduce demand for new materials, but it helps to check the device carefully.) Tj T* (Ask whether the battery has been tested, whether the phone is unlocked, and if the seller can show proof of ownership.) Tj T* (A lower price is not a good deal if the device cannot receive security updates. Reputable refurbishers usually describe) Tj T* (the condition and offer a limited warranty. The speaker suggests comparing the total expected cost, including a new) Tj T* (battery, rather than looking only at the price on the listing.) Tj T* ET
